<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

{# ── 네이버·구글 소유확인 ───────────────────────────────── #}
<meta name="naver-site-verification" content="여기에_네이버_인증코드">
<meta name="google-site-verification" content="여기에_구글_인증코드">

<title>{% if title %}{{ title }} | {{ site.title }}{% else %}{{ site.title }}{% endif %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description or site.description }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">

<meta property="og:type" content="{{ ogType or 'website' }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.title }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title or site.title }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ description or site.description }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.url }}{{ ogImage or site.ogImage }}">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">

<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="{{ site.title }}" href="/rss.xml">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/img/favicon.svg">

{# ▼▼ 기존 사이트의 CSS 경로를 그대로 쓰세요 ▼▼ #}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">

{% if jsonld %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ jsonld | safe }}</script>{% endif %}
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">본문 바로가기</a>

{# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   여기에 기존 index.html의 <header> … </header> 를
   그대로 잘라다 붙여넣으세요. 링크만 절대경로로 바꾸면 됩니다.
   예) href="#products" → href="/#products"
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
<header class="site-header">
  <a class="site-logo" href="/">
    <img src="/assets/img/favicon.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28">
    <span><strong>{{ site.title }}</strong><small>{{ site.tagline }}</small></span>
  </a>
  <nav class="site-nav">
    <a href="/#features">특징</a>
    <a href="/#products">제품</a>
    <a href="/#store">무인매장</a>
    <a href="/#cases">설치 사례</a>
    <a href="/#faq">자주 묻는 질문</a>
    <a href="/blog/">블로그</a>
  </nav>
  <a class="site-tel" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
</header>

<main id="main">
{{ content | safe }}
</main>

{# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   여기에 기존 <footer> … </footer> 를 붙여넣으세요.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
<footer class="site-footer">
  <a class="site-logo" href="/">
    <img src="/assets/img/favicon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24">
    <span>{{ site.title }}</span>
  </a>
  <nav>
    <a href="/#products">제품</a>
    <a href="/#store">무인매장</a>
    <a href="/#cases">설치 사례</a>
    <a href="/#faq">자주 묻는 질문</a>
    <a href="/blog/">블로그</a>
    <a href="/#contact">문의하기</a>
  </nav>
  <p>상담 전화 <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
  <p class="copy">© {{ site.year }} {{ site.title }}</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
